    "summary": "- `POST /v1/invoices/{id}/pay` honours `Idempotency-Key` per organization: a retry with the same key, invoice and body replays the first answer (status and body, `Idempotent-Replayed: true`) for 24 hours; a reused key with another invoice or body gets 422; a concurrent same-key request gets 409 `request_in_progress`; answers of 500 or more are not kept.\n- Two pay requests for one invoice never both charge, with or without a key: a second one during a charge gets 409 `payment_in_progress` at once.\n- `go build ./...`, `go vet ./...` and `go test ./...` pass, with new tests in `internal/api` and \n...[truncated]",
